			"notes": "### Info Overlay 2.0 — Sodium Integration & Main Menu Button\n\n*   **Sodium integration.** Basic mod settings can now be configured\n    directly inside the Sodium options menu, with a shortcut to open\n    the full YACL settings screen.\n*   **Mod button added to the main menu.** No more digging through\n    Mod Menu — open the config in one click, right from the title screen.\n*   Improved overall code reliability.\n\n---\n\n### Thank you for downloading this mod! Your support keeps me motivated to keep working on it. You can always help with development — for example, by contributing translations on Crowdin! 🎉\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/iquldev/Info-Overlay/compare/2.0...2.1"
		},
