			"notes": "### Info Overlay update, redesign, and media widget ✅\n\n- **Final rename to Info Overlay**. The mod is no longer called FPS Overlay.\n- Major **code refactoring and optimization**. The codebase was restructured and cleaned up for better performance and future updates.\n- **New overlay design** with improved layout, spacing, and visuals.\n  - Added **an option to switch back to the classic overlay style**.\n<img width=\"574\" height=\"253\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-03-25 104041\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/22150919-94df-4c97-a246-1276bd57b9e5\" />\n\n- Added **a setting for vertical widget layout**.\n<img width=\"511\" height=\"262\" alt=\"изображение\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/146efd52-687f-4db8-b797-df0a5f3bc901\" />\n\n- **Localization updated** and improved for multiple languages.\n- **Migrated to a new configuration system (YACL)**.\n  - ⚠️ This system is **experimental** and may contain bugs.\n- Added **Media Widget** that displays information about the currently playing media (song, video, etc.).\n  - Available **only for Windows 10+**.\n<img width=\"565\" height=\"279\" alt=\"изображение\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/13883044-26a6-44d4-98fd-bf3feb226b3c\" />\n\n### Thank you for downloading this mod! Thanks to you, I have the motivation to keep working. You can always help with development, for example by helping with translation on Crowdin! 🎉\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/iquldev/Info-Overlay/compare/1.9.1...2.0"
		},
