			"notes": "### New placeholders, settings, and more ✅\n\n- **Added support for Minecraft 1.21.10** (The Copper Age). Versions below 1.21.6 will no longer receive updates with new features.\n- **New partially translated languages:**\n    - Chinese (Simplified)\n    - Arabic (Saudi Arabia)\n    - Catalan (Spain)\n    - Czech\n    - Danish\n    - German\n    - Greek\n    - Spanish (Spain)\n    - Finnish\n    - French\n    - Italian\n    - Japanese\n    - Dutch\n    - Norwegian\n    - Polish\n    - Portuguese (Brazil)\n    - Portuguese (Portugal)\n    - Romanian\n    - Swedish\n    - Vietnamese\n- Code **optimization** and restructuring performed.\n- Added **a setting** that allows **highlighting in red** if the FPS drops below a certain value.\n- **New placeholders**: {currentRam}, {maxRam}, {ramPercent}, {worldTime}, {weather}, {sessionTime}\n\n### Thank you for downloading this mod! Thanks to you, I have the motivation to keep working. You can always help with development, for example by helping with translation on [Crowdin](https://crowdin.com/project/fpsoverlay)! 🎉"
		},
